\v 7 \add ≈As a result,\add* they'd¦175534 taken off and¦175535 fled¦175535 in the twilight¦175536. They'd¦175537 abandoned¦175537 their¦175540 tents¦175540 and¦175541 horses¦175543 and¦175544 donkeys¦175546—leaving the¦175547 camp¦175547 just¦175548 as¦175548 it¦175550 was¦175550, and¦175551 fled¦175551 for their¦175554 \add #lives¦175554\add*.
