\v 1 \add ≈One day\add* Elisha¦175878 spoke¦175879 to¦175880 the¦175882 \add Shunammite\add* woman¦175882 whose son¦175888 he'd¦175885 \add ≈brought back to¦175885 life¦175885\add*, “\add ≈Pack up and¦175891 leave¦175891 here\add*, you¦175892 and¦175894 your¦175894 household¦175894, and \add ≈go¦175891 and¦175895 stay somewhere else\add*, because¦175898 Yahweh's¦175901 \add ≈going to¦175906 send a seven-year drought\add*.”
