\v 7 Elisha¦176052 went¦176051 to \add Aram's capital\add* Damascus¦176053 at a time when¦176054 King¦176057 Ben¦176054-Hadad of¦176057 Aram¦176059 \add !(Syria¦176059)\add* was¦176060 \add very\add* sick¦176060, and¦176061 someone told¦176061 him¦176063 that the¦176066 man¦176066 of¦176066 God was in town.
