\v 14 \add ≈So¦176764\add* Yehu¦176765 (the son of Nimshi's¦176771 son, Yehoshafat¦176768) conspired¦176764 against¦176772 Yoram¦176774. Yoram¦176775 was¦176776 \add busy\add* \add ≈with the army\add* guarding Ramot¦176778-Gilead from¦176784 King¦176786 Haza'el of¦176786 Aram¦176788.
