\p \add ≈So¦176807\add* Yehu¦176808 told¦176807 \add >his men\add*, “If¦176809 \add ≈you all want me as king, then don't¦176813 let¦176815 anyone leave¦176815\add* this city¦176819 \add of Ramot-Gilead\add* \add ≈in case they go¦176820 to¦176821 Yizre'el¦176823 city and tell¦176821 them\add* \add >our plans\add*.”
