\v 1 \add King\add* Ahab¦177265 had seventy¦177266 sons¦177267 who lived in¦177268 Shomron¦177268 \add !(Samaria¦177268)\add*, \add ≈so¦177269\add* Yehu¦177270 sent¦177272 letters¦177271 to¦177274 the¦177276 leaders¦177276 and elders¦177278 of¦177276 Yizre'el¦177277, and¦177279 to¦177279 the guardians¦177281 of Ahab's¦177282 children, saying¦177283,
